      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first passenger train crossed Clifton Forge in 1857, and the town later became a major steam‑locomotive maintenance hub for the C&O Railroad.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
