      ],
      "source": "https://visitcliftonforgeva.com/history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Although chartered in 1906, Clifton Forge’s roots trace back to the 1700s, when it first appeared on a land grant.",
